{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14874","headline":"从军行 · 卢纶","name":"从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十在边城，军中得勇名。\n卷旗收败马，占碛拥残兵。\n覆阵乌鸢起，烧山草木明。\n塞闲思远猎，师老厌分营。\n雪岭无人迹，冰河足鴈声。\n李陵甘此没，惆怅汉公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}